%% Deployment Flow - Image Shrinker
flowchart LR
  A[GitHub Repo] --> B[GitHub Actions CI]
  B --> C{Run Steps}
  C -->|Lint| L[eslint / prettier]
  C -->|Test| T[jest / react-testing-library]
  C -->|Build| Build[Vite Build -> dist/]
  Build --> D{Has VERCEL_TOKEN?}
  D -->|Yes| Vercel[Deploy using Vercel Action or Vercel CLI]
  D -->|No| Skip[Skip deploy / store artifacts]
  Vercel --> E[Production (Vercel CDN)]
  Skip --> E
